<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Atmel raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Atmel raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards said it upgraded Atmel Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Atmel gained 1-3/8 to 24-1/2.</p>
</text>
